# Story 13: Prompt Mode (50s)
# Hook: Prompt mode lets you talk to the AI with full context.
# Duration: 50s
# Source: story-13-prompt-mode.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 7

[00:00.0 --> 00:03.0]
Prompt mode -- talk to the AI with full terminal context.

[00:03.0 --> 00:06.0]
Start rysh in shell mode.

[00:06.0 --> 00:10.0]
Double-Escape switches to prompt mode. The prompt changes to < -- now you're talking to AI.

[00:10.0 --> 00:25.0]
Ask a question in natural language. The AI sees your context.

[00:25.0 --> 00:28.0]
The AI responds with context-aware answers.

[00:28.0 --> 00:45.0]
Ask a follow-up -- the AI remembers the conversation.

[00:45.0 --> 00:50.0]
Prompt mode gives you an AI assistant that lives inside your terminal.

